---
import OptimizedImage from "../../../components/OptimizedImage.astro";
---
<div class="w-full"><OptimizedImage src="/assets/images/projects/bento-recipe/cover.webp" alt="表紙" width="2400" height="1768" class="block w-full h-auto" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" /></div>

    <article class="px-6 mb:px-16 dt:px-35 pt-10">
      <header>
        <h1 class="font-extrabold text-2xl mb:text-[32px] leading-10">お弁当レシピ - LP / アプリデザイン</h1>
      </header>
      <p class="mt-5 text-[16px] leading-6 font-normal text-pretty wrap-break-word max-w-225">Caeruxlab 在籍中に担当したプロジェクトです。</p>
      <p class="mt-5 text-[16px] leading-6 font-medium">カテゴリー : モバイル LP デザイン &amp; アプリデザイン<br>クライアント : Caeruxlab<br>使用ツール : Adobe XD</p>

      <section class="mt-14 mb:mt-16" aria-label="画面">
        <h2 class="sr-only">作品</h2>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-10 mb:gap-12.5 items-start">
        <div class="w-full max-w-250 mx-auto"><OptimizedImage src="/assets/images/projects/bento-recipe/01.webp" alt="画面 1" width="2400" height="1768" class="block w-full h-auto rounded-md" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /></div>
        <div class="w-full max-w-250 mx-auto"><OptimizedImage src="/assets/images/projects/bento-recipe/03.webp" alt="画面 3" width="2400" height="1768" class="block w-full h-auto rounded-md" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /></div>
        <div class="w-full max-w-250 mx-auto"><OptimizedImage src="/assets/images/projects/bento-recipe/04.webp" alt="画面 4" width="2400" height="1768" class="block w-full h-auto rounded-md" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /></div>
        <div class="w-full max-w-250 mx-auto"><OptimizedImage src="/assets/images/projects/bento-recipe/05.webp" alt="画面 5" width="2400" height="1767" class="block w-full h-auto rounded-md" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /></div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <div class="mt-15 flex flex-col items-center gap-8">
        <p class="font-extrabold text-2xl mb:text-[32px] leading-10 text-center">ご覧いただき、ありがとうございました！</p>
      </div>

      <a href="/jp/ui-design" id="back-link" class="img-btn block w-34 h-6.5 mt-17 mb-21 bg-left!" style="background-image:url(/assets/icons/back.png)" aria-label="もどる" title="もどる"></a>
    </article>
